# Keep the build context small: none of these are copied into any image, but
# without this file all 3GB of them get shipped to the Docker daemon on every
# build. The hosted Dockerfile bakes in only the oracle files. data/ and the repo generally are bind-mounted at runtime (-v $PWD:/code),
# not baked in. bin/ is deliberately NOT ignored - Dockerfile.server copies it.
.git
data
!data/oracle-cards.json
!data/oracle-tags.jsonl
ui/public/data
ui/public/index_bundle.js
**/node_modules
tmp
*.created
